1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,975
Five things you must do in the
Dominican Republic.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:09,420
Do watch humpback whales in Samana
Bay, from mid January to the end
of March.

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:16,372
Do walk the Colonial Zone in Santo
Domingo, a UNESCO World
Heritage Site since nineteen
ninety.

4
00:00:17,412 --> 00:00:18,565
Do dance the merengue.

5
00:00:18,605 --> 00:00:21,763
UNESCO added it to its
heritage list in twenty sixteen.

6
00:00:22,803 --> 00:00:27,498
Do take a boat to Saona Island,
and swim in a natural pool full of
starfish.

7
00:00:28,538 --> 00:00:31,978
And do hike Pico Duarte, the
highest peak in the Caribbean.

8
00:00:32,018 --> 00:00:34,338
You need a guide, and at least two
days.
